    "glbVerified": "animal-fox.glb @ glbBase -> HTTP 200 (2026-07-14). Alle 24 Pets liegen dort, per raw-URL ladbar (CORS *).",
    "colormap": "IM GLB EINGEBETTET - kein Extra-File (beide colormap.png-Kandidaten 404). Recolor ueber Material-Tint (recolorDefault / pet.color).",
